      },
      "cr": 4,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet — Cordon Sentry Walker.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>cordon-sentry-walker</code>): Large construct (walker), Unaligned; CR 4 (proficiency +2, to hit +6 with STR); AC 16 (riveted hull plating), hit points 76 (8d10+32), speed 35 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Two-legged walkers deployed along border fences and perimeter trenches. The walker's elevated cabin provides long line-of-sight across foggy terrain, and its pneumatic harpoons can snag fleeing vehicles or beasts.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> mobile harpoon platform · <strong>tier:</strong> Combat Strider · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Magitek Automata.</p><h3>Art</h3><p><strong>Awaiting its plate.</strong> The render <code>npc-forge/iron-legion/renders/cordon-sentry-walker.png</code> has not been cut yet; run the NPC Forge (or <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py plates iron-legion</code>) and rebuild. Seed 510011. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A rugged two-legged mechanical patrol strider constructed of matte-grey armor plates. It features an armored observation cabin on top with narrow vision slits, tall hydraulic legs, and twin mounted heavy harpoon launchers on its shoulders. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
